# The build context is this directory, so everything the image should not carry
# is excluded here. node_modules in particular: the host tree holds binaries and
# browsers built for the host platform, and copying them into a Linux image
# would shadow the ones `npm ci` installs.
node_modules/
**/node_modules/

# Outputs, all regenerated inside the container.
**/playwright-report/
**/blob-report/
**/reports/
**/test-results/
**/.stryker-tmp/

.git/
**/.env
*.log
